message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "@three-ws/metaplex-agent-mcp"
abstract: "Deploy AI agents on-chain into the Metaplex Agent Registry on Solana: one atomic transaction mints a Metaplex Core asset (data: URI metadata, verified creator, royalties, immutable metadata) and registers its EIP-8004 agent identity, so the agent lands with its own on-chain wallet. Agents sign with their own key; people sign with Phantom, Solflare, or any Solana wallet via the prepare/send flow. A flat mainnet deploy fee funds $THREE buybacks and is waived for $THREE holders. Every Core plugin and every metadata field is customizable."
version: 0.2.1
